t/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un servidor PostgreSQL accesible y un rol autorizado para crear bases de datos y schemas"},"202":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-14","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un broker RabbitMQ accesible y sus credenciales"},"203":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-15","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un proveedor OIDC, normalmente Keycloak, con un realm/tenant y un cliente para Lamassu"},"204":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-16","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Envoy Gateway 1.8+ y una `GatewayClass`"},"205":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-17","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"cert-manager 1.14+; para TLS de confianza, un emisor de confianza o un Secret TLS de Kubernetes"},"206":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-18","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"una StorageClass y un diseño de tráfico externo"},"207":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-19","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart usa por defecto una `GatewayClass` llamada `eg`. Cambia `gateway.className` si tu equipo de plataforma utiliza otro nombre."},"208":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-20","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Tú proporcionas el servidor PostgreSQL. El job de pre-install del chart se conecta con las credenciales indicadas, crea las bases de datos `pki`, `authz` y `wfx` y los schemas de los servicios, ejecuta las migraciones y aplica `services.authz.bootstrap`."},"209":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-21","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart no tiene dependencias Helm que instalen PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, un proveedor OIDC, Envoy Gateway ni cert-manager."},"210":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-22","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala o actualiza las CRD de Envoy Gateway antes de su controlador. Estos comandos usan la misma versión que el repositorio Helm de Lamassu:"},"211":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-23","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Crea la `GatewayClass` predeterminada si todavía no existe. Guarda este manifiesto como `gateway-class.yaml`:"},"212":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-24","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala cert-manager por separado antes de Lamassu. El chart actual renderiza sus recursos de issuer self-signed y certificado CA incluso cuando `tls.type: external` hace que el Gateway use un Secret TLS existente. Seleccionar TLS externo no elimina por tanto el requisito de cert-manager."},"213":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-25","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Parte de los valores predeterminados del chart y sobrescribe los específicos del entorno. Este ejemplo supone que PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak son accesibles mediante DNS de Kubernetes y expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del Gateway compartido:"},"214":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-26","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"No añadas `gateway.addresses` por defecto. Deja la asignación de dirección a la implementación del balanceador salvo que tu diseño de red requiera una VIP concreta en Kubernetes. La IP pública de un NAT o proxy upstream no corresponde a este valor."},"215":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-27","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Si Keycloak es externo y ya tiene una URL accesible, apunta la configuración OIDC hacia él y omite la entrada `/auth` de `gateway.extraRouting`."},"216":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-28","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-con-un-secret-existente","content":"Crea un Secret con `tls.crt` y `tls.key` y referéncialo:"},"217":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-29","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"No existe un superusuario implícito. Crea en el proveedor OIDC el rol o grupo esperado por `services.authz.bootstrap` y asígnalo al menos a un administrador antes de exponer Lamassu."},"218":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-30","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El job de pre-install y pre-upgrade aplica el bootstrap de forma idempotente: conserva los principales existentes y añade los grants que falten."},"219":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-31","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Prueba una identidad autorizada y otra denegada. Si ningún token coincide con un principal activo del bootstrap, nadie podrá administrar la PKI."},"220":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-32","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Consulta Control de acceso para conocer el modelo de principales y políticas."},"221":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-33","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#3-instala-lamassu","content":"Para instalar un checkout local:"},"222":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-34","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"El Gateway debe mostrar `PROGRAMMED=True`. Si está programado pero no tiene una dirección utilizable, continúa con Expón el Gateway."},"223":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-35","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"El test de Helm comprueba los endpoints de salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y verifica la respuesta de la UI."},"224":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-36","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"Antes de pasar a producción, revisa:"},"225":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-37","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"backup y recuperación de PostgreSQL y volúmenes persistentes"},"226":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-38","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"un motor KMS de producción; el motor filesystem predeterminado no ofrece alta disponibilidad"},"227":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-39","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"almacenamiento compartido para VA antes de aumentar sus réplicas"},"228":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-40","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"roles OIDC gestionados y eliminación de credenciales de evaluación"},"229":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-41","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"un emisor TLS de confianza o un certificado gestionado externamente"},"230":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-42","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"recursos, réplicas, autoscaling, disruption budgets y placement"},"231":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-43","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"SMTP, observabilidad y entrega de alertas"},"232":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-44","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"las notas de migración de `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/` antes de cada upgrade"},"233":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-45","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"La referencia completa de valores se mantiene en `charts/lamassu/VALUES.md` dentro del repositorio Helm."},"234":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"page","content":"Expón el Gateway","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking"},"235":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-0","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","content":"Elige cómo llegan los clientes a Lamassu, cuándo definir gateway.addresses y cómo diseñar varios Gateways."},"236":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-1","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"Expón el Gateway de Lamassu"},"237":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-2","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"¿Necesitas `gateway.addresses`?"},"238":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-3","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Diseño recomendado para un solo nodo"},"239":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-4","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"K3s"},"240":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-5","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#bare-metal-con-metallb-o-kube-vip","content":"Bare metal con MetalLB o kube-vip"},"241":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-6","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-externo-nat-o-vpn","content":"Proxy externo, NAT o VPN"},"242":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-7","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"¿Qué ocurre si necesitas tres Gateways?"},"243":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-8","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Guía de decisión"},"244":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-9","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Verifica la ruta de tráfico"},"245":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-10","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"El chart de Lamassu crea un Gateway compartido con listeners HTTP y HTTPS. Envoy Gateway crea normalmente un deployment de proxy dedicado y un Service `LoadBalancer`."},"246":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-11","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"La accesibilidad externa depende de toda la ruta. Un recurso `Gateway` no configura por sí mismo el router, firewall, DNS, balanceador cloud ni NAT upstream."},"247":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-12","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Normalmente no. Si lo omites, el controlador del Gateway y la implementación del balanceador pueden asignar una dirección y publicarla en `Gateway.status.addresses` y en el estado del Service generado."},"248":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-13","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Defínelo únicamente cuando:"},"249":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-14","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"tu balanceador cloud o bare metal permite solicitar una dirección concreta"},"250":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-15","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"esa dirección está asignada a este Gateway"},"251":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-16","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"la red ya enruta el tráfico de esa dirección hasta el clúster"},"252":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-17","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Esto solicita `192.168.1.50`; no reclama la IP en tu LAN ni la vuelve accesible."},"253":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-18","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"No confundas estos valores:"},"254":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-19","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"`gateway.addresses` solicita una dirección para el Gateway."},"255":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-20","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"`tls.certManagerOptions.certSpec.addresses` añade direcciones IP a los SAN del certificado TLS."},"256":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-21","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Si los usuarios se conectan por DNS, añade el nombre a `tls.certManagerOptions.certSpec.hostnames`. No copies la IP pública de un proxy upstream en `gateway.addresses`."},"257":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-22","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Para una VM pequeña con K3s o MicroK8s, usa un único Gateway externo de Lamassu y enruta todos los endpoints a través de él:"},"258":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-23","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Este diseño utiliza una IP, un punto de entrada TLS y un único par de puertos. El chart ya crea las rutas necesarias."},"259":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-24","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"K3s ServiceLB implementa cada Service `LoadBalancer` mediante pods que reservan los puertos del Service en el nodo. En un único nodo, solo un Service puede ocupar el puerto 80 y otro el 443. El Service Traefik que K3s instala por defecto puede estar ocupando ambos."},"260":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-25","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Para el diseño recomendado:"},"261":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-26","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Usa un único Gateway de Lamassu expuesto externamente."},"262":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-27","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Comprueba que los puertos 80 y 443 están libres. Deshabilita o reconfigura Traefik si no forma parte de la ruta de tráfico."},"263":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-28","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Permite esos puertos en el firewall de la VM y en cualquier security group upstream."},"264":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-29","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Apunta DNS a la dirección accesible de la VM."},"265":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-30","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Consulta la documentación de K3s ServiceLB para conocer el uso de host ports y cómo sustituirlo por otro balanceador."},"266":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-31","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#bare-metal-con-metallb-o-kube-vip","content":"Asigna una VIP de un pool accesible desde la LAN. Puedes solicitarla con `gateway.addresses` si la implementación lo permite. Confirma la dirección asignada en el estado en lugar de asumir que la solicitud tuvo éxito."},"267":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-32","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-externo-nat-o-vpn","content":"Una dirección pública externa puede reenviar TCP 80 y 443 a la VM o a una VIP de Kubernetes:"},"268":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-33","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-externo-nat-o-vpn","content":"La IP pública pertenece al dispositivo externo. Deja `gateway.addresses` sin definir o usa la dirección real del lado de Kubernetes, nunca una IP que el clúster no pueda asociar."},"269":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-34","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Primero decide si necesitas tres data planes independientes o solo tres nombres de host."},"270":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-35","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Requisito"},"271":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-36","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Diseño recomendado"},"272":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-37","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Consecuencia"},"273":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-38","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Varias URL o servicios de Lamassu"},"274":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-39","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Un Gateway con varias rutas"},"275":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-40","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Una IP y un proxy fleet; es el comportamiento predeterminado del chart"},"276":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-41","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Gateways independientes e IP externas distintas"},"277":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-42","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Una VIP por Gateway"},"278":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-43","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Todos pueden usar 80/443; requiere un balanceador con un pool de direcciones"},"279":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-44","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Gateways independientes, un nodo y una IP"},"280":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-45","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Puertos externos diferentes"},"281":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-46","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Los clientes deben indicar puertos no estándar"},"282":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-47","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Terminación TLS/mTLS separada detrás de una IP"},"283":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-48","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Front door con enrutamiento SNI hacia Gateways internos"},"284":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-49","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Diseño avanzado; el front door usa TLS passthrough y cada Gateway termina su propio TLS"},"285":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-50","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Recursos Gateway separados pero proxy compartido"},"286":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-51","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Modo merged Gateway de Envoy"},"287":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-52","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Solo separación lógica; cada listener necesita una tupla única de puerto, protocolo y hostname"},"288":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-53","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Tres Services `LoadBalancer` independientes no pueden reservar a la vez los mismos puertos 80 y 443 mediante K3s ServiceLB. Usa un Gateway compartido, asigna VIP distintas con otro balanceador o utiliza puertos diferentes."},"289":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-54","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Envoy Gateway provisiona normalmente un proxy fleet por `Gateway`. Su modo merged Gateway puede compartir un fleet y una dirección, pero no es un cambio directo para varias releases de Lamassu: los listeners generados usan los mismos puertos y protocolos sin hostnames distintos, por lo que entran en conflicto salvo que personalices el diseño."},"290":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-55","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Usa un front door con SNI solo cuando los Gateways internos deban mantener políticas TLS o mTLS independientes:"},"291":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-56","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Esto requiere hostnames SNI distintos y configuración de red externa al chart de Lamassu."},"292":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-57","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si un Gateway puede gestionar TLS y el enrutamiento, usa el valor predeterminado del chart."},"293":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-58","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si los Gateways necesitan políticas independientes y puedes asignar IP, usa una VIP por Gateway."},"294":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-59","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si solo necesitas separar los recursos Kubernetes, evalúa merged Gateway y usa tuplas de listener únicas."},"295":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-60","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si los data planes y la terminación TLS deben ser independientes detrás de una IP, añade un front door con TLS passthrough y SNI."},"296":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-61","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si nada de lo anterior es posible, usa puertos externos distintos o cambia el diseño de red."},"297":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-62","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Comprueba, en orden:"},"298":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-63","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El `Gateway` muestra `Accepted=True` y `Programmed=True`."},"299":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-64","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Su estado contiene la dirección esperada."},"300":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-65","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El Service `LoadBalancer` generado tiene una dirección externa utilizable."},"301":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-66","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El puerto 443 de esa dirección es accesible desde la red del cliente."},"302":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-67","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"DNS resuelve al endpoint accesible externamente."},"303":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-68","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El certificado contiene el nombre DNS o la IP usada por el cliente."},"304":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-69","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Gateway API trata las direcciones como estado deseado que el controlador puede asignar o rechazar; consulta la introducción a Gateway API para conocer el modelo."},"305":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"page","content":"Kubernetes self-managed","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview"},"306":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","content":"Elige un flujo de instalación y una arquitectura de red para Lamassu en tu clúster Kubernetes."},"307":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#despliegue-self-managed-con-kubernetes","content":"Despliegue self-managed con Kubernetes"},"308":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Elige un flujo de instalación"},"309":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Qué proporciona el cha