":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Verifica el DNS y puerto configurados en externalAuthorization."},"404":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba que la ruta del check es /v1/ext\\_authz/check."},"405":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"No cambies a failOpen: true como solución permanente: permitiría tráfico sin autorización durante la caída."},"406":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Revisa primero kubectl describe pod. Las causas habituales son:"},"407":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"credenciales o DNS incorrectos para PostgreSQL o RabbitMQ;"},"408":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"volumen persistente sin enlazar;"},"409":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"imagen inaccesible o política de pull incorrecta;"},"410":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"configuración inválida del motor criptográfico;"}